Z||000000||william_thorniii||10-11-2000||05:39 PM||||Friends,<P>I just can't keep my big mouth shut.  I was trying to allow Street Dreams to get the word out at their discrection.... but here goes.  <P>Street Dreams will have 7 sets of drop spindles ready for delivery early next week.  I have ordered a set already, so that leaves 6 (assuming others haven't spoken for them already).  <P>They have been working on these for almost a year now and I have been bugging them every bit of the way.  You can imagine how excited both myself and Street Dreams are now that we can finally drop the "When will they be ready?" cat and mouse game.  <P>They are still having huge problems with their foundry and do not know at what rate they will be able to produce these after the first batch are gone.  <P>The contact information is as follows:<P>Street Dreams<BR>4833 Cherry Valley Rd<BR>Middleville, MI 49333<BR>616.795.3100<BR>email: strdream@iserv.net<P>Good Luck,<P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||2
